================================================================================
                           ATTRIBUTION REQUIREMENTS
================================================================================

When using or modifying this work, you must:

1. Credit the original author:
   Oriol Rius <oriol@joor.net>

2. Provide a link to the original repository:
   https://github.com/oriolrius/rds-pg

3. Indicate if changes were made and provide a brief description of modifications.

4. Include this license file or a link to it.

Example attribution:
  "Based on rds-pg by Oriol Rius (https://github.com/oriolrius/rds-pg),
   licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0. Changes: [describe your modifications]"

